OL,3,GNEWSACouncil estates saved from
OL,4,Ademolition, 12 years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FA south London council has pledged to
OL,7,Frepair two housing estates rather than
OL,8,Fdemolish them, ending 12 years of
OL,9,Funcertainty for residents.
OL,11,FGreen Party-led Lambeth Council voted
OL,12,Fto remove Central Hill in Norwood and
OL,13,FCressingham Gardens in Tulse Hill from
OL,14,Fits redevelopment programme, at a
OL,15,Fcabinet meeting last Wednesday.
OL,17,FCouncillor Scott Ainslie said residents
OL,18,Fhad "lived under the threat of
OL,19,Fdemolition", adding: "That ends now.
OL,20,FThese homes will be kept, maintained
OL,21,Fproperly, and repaired."
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
